## Plan

### Step 1: Convert heartbeat-daemon.ts sync → async
- Import `fs/promises` instead of sync `fs` functions
- Convert all functions to async:
  - `ensureHeartbeatFile()` → async
  - `runHeartbeat()` → async, use `spawn` stream-based instead of `execSync`
  - `HeartbeatDaemon.start()` → async
  - `HeartbeatDaemon.writePidFile()` → async
  - `HeartbeatDaemon.removePidFile()` → async
  - `readDaemonPid()` → async
  - `stopDaemonByPid()` → async
- Use `child_process.spawn` with promise wrapper instead of `execSync`
- Use `Promise.all` for parallel I/O where possible

### Step 2: Update callers
- `src/cli/commands/heartbeat.ts` — the only importer, needs await

